  "result": "I fixed the limit check in `createProject` in `src/server/services/project-service.ts`, which caused the off-by-one. I haven't run the test suite.\n\nThe check called `wouldExceedLimit(org.plan, \"projects\", used, 0)`. That helper blocks only when `used + requested > limit`. With `requested` set to 0, an organization already at its limit passed the check (`limit + 0 > limit` is false), so the extra project got created. Only the attempt after that one was refused. I removed the `0` so it uses the default of 1, and a project that would take the organization past its limit is now refused.",
